msgid "Enable locking of assessments by teachers"
msgstr "Aktiver låsing av vurderinger av lærere"

msgid "Once enabled, this option will enable locking of any assessment by the teachers of the corresponding course. This, in turn, will prevent any modification of results by the teacher inside the resources used in the assessment: exams, learning paths, tasks, etc. The only role authorized to unlock a locked assessment is the administrator. The teacher will be informed of this possibility. The locking and unlocking of gradebooks will be registered in the system's report of important activities"
msgstr "Når dette alternativet er aktivert, vil det tillate lærere i det aktuelle kurset å låse enhver vurdering. Dette vil forhindre at læreren endrer resultater i ressursene som brukes i vurderingen: eksamener, læringsstier, oppgaver osv. Den eneste rollen som har autorisasjon til å låse opp en låst vurdering er administratoren. Læreren vil bli informert om denne muligheten. Låsing og opplåsing av karakterbøker vil bli registrert i systemets rapport over viktige aktiviteter"

msgid "Shibboleth authentication"
msgstr "Shibboleth-autentisering"

msgid "<p>First of all, you have to configure Shibboleth for your web server.</p>To configure it for Chamilo<h5>edit file main/auth/shibboleth/config/aai.class.php</h5><p>Modify object &#36;result values with the name of your Shibboleth attributes</p><ul><li>&#36;result-&gt;unique_id = 'mail';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;firstname = 'cn';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;lastname = 'uid';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;email = 'mail';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;language = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;gender = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;address = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;staff_category = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;home_organization_type = '-'; </li><li>&#36;result-&gt;home_organization = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;affiliation = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;persistent_id = '-';</li><li>...</li></ul><br/>Go to <a href='settings.php?category=Shibboleth'>Plugin</a> to add a configurable 'Shibboleth Login' button for your Chamilo campus."
msgstr "<p>Først må du konfigurere Shibboleth for webserveren din.</p>For å konfigurere det for Chamilo<h5>rediger filen main/auth/shibboleth/config/aai.class.php</h5><p>Endre objekt &#36;result-verdiene med navnet på Shibboleth-attributtene dine</p><ul><li>&#36;result-&gt;unique_id = 'mail';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;firstname = 'cn';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;lastname = 'uid';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;email = 'mail';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;language = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;gender = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;address = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;staff_category = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;home_organization_type = '-'; </li><li>&#36;result-&gt;home_organization = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;affiliation = '-';</li><li>&#36;result-&gt;persistent_id = '-';</li><li>...</li></ul><br/>Gå til <a href='settings.php?category=Shibboleth'>Utvidelse</a> for å legge til en konfigurerbar 'Shibboleth-påloggingsknapp' for Chamilo-campusen din."

msgid "LDAP authentication"
msgstr "LDAP-autentisering"

msgid "Facebook authentication"
msgstr "Facebook-autentisering"

msgid "<p><h5>Create your Facebook Application</h5>First of all, you have to create a Facebook Application (see <a href='https://developers.facebook.com/apps'>https://developers.facebook.com/apps</a>) with your Facebook account. In the Facebook Apps settings, the site URL value should be the URL of this campus. Enable the Web OAuth Login option. And add the site URL of your campus to the Valid OAuth redirect URIs field</p><p>Uncomment the line <code>&#36;_configuration['facebook_auth'] = 1;</code> to enable the Facebook Auth.</p><p>Then, edit the <code>app/config/auth.conf.php</code> file and enter '<code>appId</code>' and '<code>secret</code>' values for <code>&#36;facebook_config</code>.</p><p>Go to <a href='settings.php?category=Plugins'>Plugins</a> to add a configurable <em>Facebook Login</em> button for your Chamilo campus.</p>"
msgstr "<p><h5>Opprett Facebook-applikasjonen din</h5>Først må du opprette en Facebook-applikasjon (se <a href='https://developers.facebook.com/apps'>https://developers.facebook.com/apps</a>) med Facebook-kontoen din. I Facebook Apps-innstillingene skal nettstedets URL være URL-en til denne campusen. Aktiver alternativet Web OAuth Login. Legg til nettstedets URL for campusen din i feltet Valid OAuth redirect URIs</p><p>Fjern kommentartegnet fra linjen <code>&#36;_configuration['facebook_auth'] = 1;</code> for å aktivere Facebook-autentisering.</p><p>Rediger deretter filen <code>app/config/auth.conf.php</code> og angi '<code>appId</code>' og '<code>secret</code>'-verdier for <code>&#36;facebook_config</code>.</p><p>Gå til <a href='settings.php?category=Plugins'>Utvidelser</a> for å legge til en konfigurerbar <em>Facebook-påloggingsknapp</em> for Chamilo-campusen din.</p>"

